      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SHA TIN KING (4) was safely held last time out, finishing eighth at Healesville over 350m behind Mighty Mikado (20.53) in a Grade 5. Form from his last run is proving strong. Ready to return to form. GAME OF PHONES (6) turned in a solid run last start over 300m at Healesville finishing 5th and beaten only 3 lengths (17.34). Form here at the trip sound including two wins. Comes through a solid form race last start. Should be thereabouts. PAW LARA (7) was midfield throughout and finished there last time when 4th (23.33) at Warragul. Yet to win here but has run some good races. Has a very good strike-rate from this draw, with two wins from five starts. Key runner who gets her chance to atone. BEAR IT IS (1) is a last-start placegetter who will have admirers.",
